---
description: >-
  a name or text value written as a markdown string ("`…`") is read as
  markdown; any other label is plain: its tags draw, and a code span or a list
  marker in it is drawn as written (#1368; was #763, D564). Plain
  **markers** drawn as written are in pr-check/label-syntax.mmd, which warns.
---
requirementDiagram
requirement "`**bold**`" {
id: 1
text: "`*it*`"
}
requirement "<b>strong</b> name" {
id: 2
text: "- not a <i>bullet</i>"
}
element "`code` element" {
type: "`sim`"
}
